<title>FRANCE: Lagardere requotes up at 170 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Lagardere requotes up at 170 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French congolemrate Lagardere Groupe requoted at 170 francs per share on Thursday, after being suspended limit up at several successive attempts to trade during the morning.</p>
<p>The shares closed on Tuesday at 133.10 francs and were suspended on Wednesday as the French government announced Lagardere was its preferred bidder in the privatisation of Thomson SA.</p>
</text>
